      "name": "Rejuvenation",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "description": "<p>When a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> days within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.</p>",
